  "text": "## Subject Access Request (SAR) Process  \n**Customer Right:** Obtain copy of personal data  \n**Process:**  \n1. **Request Submission**\n- Email: privacy@firstuk.bank\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- In person: Any branch  \n2. **Verification**\n- FirstUK Bank verifies customer identity\n- May request additional identification\n- Security check (fraud prevention)  \n3. **Compilation**\n- Collect data from all systems\n- Remove third-party personal data (may redact)\n- Compile in accessible format  \n4. **Response**\n- Data provided within 30 days\n- Format: Electronic (CSV, PDF, etc.)\n- May extend 2 months for complex requests  \n5. **Redactions**\n- Legal professional privilege redacted\n- Third-party confidential data redacted\n- Trade secrets redacted  \n---",
